<title>POLAND: Kable Q2 net rises to PLN 0.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Kable Q2 net rises to PLN 0.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kable preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.41 vs	1.00</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   0.68 vs	0.06 loss</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.68 vs	0.06 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: lska Fabryka Kabli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 36.14 vs     34.98</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  32.46 vs     30.02</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.01 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				  na vs	  na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.62 vs	0.41</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.35 vs	1.47</p>
<p>    investment				 1.93 vs	4.30</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 4.21 vs	0.75</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.49 vs	0.26</p>
<p>    net profit				 2.48 vs	0.25</p>
<p>    net sales				 70.84 vs     68.34</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  60.20 vs     60.78</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
